endpoint.response:
Figures += { cost_labor: number, labor_minutes: int, unpriced_minutes: int }
cost_actual = cost_manual + cost_committed + cost_invoiced + cost_labor; margin_actual, cost_delta, margin_delta coerenti.
Vale per totals, by_business_function[] (ripartizione D-11) e segments[] (+ by_business_function annidato).

FunctionTrendRow += { labor: number[] }   (cost include labor)
totals += { labor: number[], labor_minutes: int[], unpriced_minutes: int[], previous_year.labor: number[] }
by_nature invariato (solo costi passivi).

{ success: true, message: "OK", data: {
    applied: { date_from, date_to, company_id: int[], top: int },
    today: "YYYY-MM-DD",
    totals: AgentFigures & { agents_count: int, pending_document_count: int },
    agents: AgentRow[],                  (top N per to_settle desc, poi accrued desc)
    others: AgentFigures & { agents_count: int, pending_document_count: int } | null,   (null se nessun altro agente)
    by_month: { month: "YYYY-MM", accrued: number, paid: number }[]   (tutti i mesi del periodo)
} }
AgentFigures = { accrued: number, to_settle: number, in_statement: number, approved_unpaid: number, paid: number }
AgentRow = { referent: { id: int, name: string }, pending_document_count: int, ...AgentFigures }
Importi: maturati imponibili (come i maturati), estratti e pagamenti come registrati (net_payable, paid_amount);
number a 2 decimali. Invarianti: somma agents + others = totals campo per campo; somma by_month.accrued =
totals.accrued; somma by_month.paid = totals.paid.
